From 8fc3606fdb59761827041fe3c7ab7f47f42e8216 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jon <jon@pionex.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 22:54:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] powervr: add firmware for BXM-4-64 revision 36.56.104.183

Adds powervr/rogue_36.56.104.183_v1.fw (version 1.1.OS@6976702), the open-ABI
firmware for the PowerVR BXM-4-64 MC1 at BVNC 36.56.104.183. That is the GPU
in the Allwinner A733 (sun60i) -- Radxa Cubie A7A/A7Z -- one silicon revision
from the 36.52.104.182 already listed here for the T-HEAD TH1520.

Taken from Imagination's firmware tree,
https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/imagination/linux-firmware, branch "powervr",
commit 8a58f81883f7be458daa34e418cc4079f995b279 ("Update to version
1.1.OS@6976702"), byte-identical to the file the A733 vendor BSP ships.

sha256: 1db1c399c17401d1f79d46c880db81c724d748c784d4639433b076aba2f9c0d2

Signed-off-by: Jon <jon@pionex.com>
---
 WHENCE                            |   1 +
 powervr/rogue_36.56.104.183_v1.fw | Bin 0 -> 131072 bytes
 2 files changed, 1 insertion(+)
 create mode 100644 powervr/rogue_36.56.104.183_v1.fw

